      "writtenOn": "2019-12-13T11:30:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should this be context.createContextAsUser(UserHandle.ALL, 0).getSystemService(...) ?\nOtherwise notifications may not show properly when under other users ?\n\nAlternatively add a comment saying that tethering is always controlled from user 0, so the notifications are also shown from that context only ?\n\nI\u0027m not sure what the current behavior is when switching to secondary users. Maybe you could have a try ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 68,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 68,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "c1feb0c3c9b05e274dfd0ab42f508e692a0c2756",
